        "title": "OUR SUSTAINABILITY PROMISE",
        "content": "<p>Luxury shouldn’t cost the earth.We’re committed to being part of a better future for fragrance through:</p><ul><li><strong>Minimal, recyclable packaging</strong></li><li><strong>Paperless shipping</strong> wherever possible</li><li><strong>A low-waste production approach</strong></li><li><strong>Timeless, reusable glass bottles</strong> designed to last</li></ul><p>Good fragrance can and should be kinder to the world around us.</p>",
